    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok that makes sense. but i've heard some people say that if you look at the actual biology, sex is the only thing that really determines how we're categorized. some people say the \"consensus\" you mentioned is more about social theory than hard science. how do scientists actually reconcile the biological reality of sex with this idea of identity?",
